<p>Hi {!Opportunity.OwnerFirstName},</p>

<p>
An Opportunity assigned to you has remained in the same sales stage longer than the agreed business threshold.
</p>

<p><strong>Key Details:</strong></p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Opportunity:</strong> {!Opportunity.Name}</li>
    <li><strong>Customer:</strong> {!Opportunity.Account}</li>
    <li><strong>Current Stage:</strong> {!Opportunity.StageName}</li>
    <li><strong>Days in Current Stage:</strong> {!Opportunity.Days_In_Current_Stage_CC__c}</li>
    <li><strong>Opportunity Value:</strong> {!Opportunity.Amount}</li>
</ul>

<p>
Please review the Opportunity in Salesforce and either progress it to the next stage or update it with the current status.
</p>

<p>
<a href="{!Opportunity.Link}">View Opportunity in Salesforce</a>
</p>

<p>
Thank you,<br>
Carlton Packaging CRM
</p>